# Allowlist, not denylist. ~/.claude holds a live OAuth token, session keys and
# 2.6G of transcripts and state; a denylist is one missed pattern from leaking
# them into a public repo, so this ignores everything and opts files back in.
*
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!bin/
!bin/claude-turn-diff.sh
!bin/cc-sessions
